<mjml>
<!--
  IMPECCABLE DIRECTION CONTRACT
  THESIS: this is the one place a red/error treatment would seem obvious and
  is deliberately rejected — DESIGN.md's error-red is documented as a UI
  validation color (form errors, destructive actions), never established as
  an email-banner tone, and a routine account hold (credit, admin review,
  whatever the reason) reading as an alarm is worse UX than the actual fact
  being communicated. Light Blue Grey — a step up from Request Declined's
  plain white (this is a bigger deal: an ACTIVE relationship paused, not a
  request that never started), but still calm and neutral, not a status
  color at all. The copy carries the weight, not the color.
  OWN-WORLD: apps/portal/DESIGN.md, inherited from invite.mjml — same
  header/footer chrome, same floated-identity technique, `light-blue-grey`
  token (#E6ECF2) as the band fill — the same hex already used everywhere
  else in this set as the hairline border color, reused here as a fill for
  the first time; still a real DESIGN.md token, not an invented tint.
  No CTA — nothing to click while suspended (portalUrl is always null for
  this event; see notification-payload.ts's own comment on why).
  STORY: a customer whose account was suspended understands plainly what
  that means for them right now, and knows who to ask about it.
  FIRST VIEWPORT: header, one neutral-tinted section — headline, identity +
  the suspension sentence, what it means in practice — then the footer.
  FORM: extends the established world; direction was already set.
  FINISH: verified via a real MJML render/screenshot + a real MailHog send.
-->
<mj-head>
  <mj-title>Your account with {{distributorName}} has been suspended</mj-title>
  <mj-font name="Inter" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" />
  <mj-attributes>
    <mj-text font-size="14px" font-weight="400" line-height="1.5" color="#0B1D3A" padding="0" />
  </mj-attributes>
  <mj-style>
    @media only screen and (max-width:480px) {
      .distributor-byline-logo {
        width: 44px !important;
        height: 44px !important;
        border-radius: 23px !important;
      }
    }
  </mj-style>
</mj-head>
<mj-body background-color="#F2F4F7" width="480px">

  {{> header}}

  <mj-section background-color="#E6ECF2" padding="32px 32px 32px" border-left="1px solid #E6ECF2" border-right="1px solid #E6ECF2">
    <mj-column>
      <mj-text font-size="24px" font-weight="600" line-height="1.3" color="#0B1D3A" padding-bottom="16px">
        Account suspended
      </mj-text>
      {{> identity-row}}
      <mj-text color="#5B6B7F" padding-bottom="0">
        You won't be able to place orders with them until they lift the suspension.
      </mj-text>
    </mj-column>
  </mj-section>

  {{> footer}}

</mj-body>
</mjml>
